{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-omega-constraints","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:omega-constraints","kind":"remark","title":"Algebraic constraints in the $\\omega_k$ basis","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quaternionic-spectral-resolvents","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-self-dual-curvature"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quaternionic-spectral-resolvents","text":"omega-constraints.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:omega-constraints\"></a><p>In the spectral resolvent basis (<a href=\"#def:quaternionic-spectral-resolvents\" data-at=\"brings-surface/spectral-gauge\">quaternionic spectral resolvents</a>), Bring's surface equations enforce three constraints:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Barycentric:</em> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\omega_0=0</code>.</li>\n<li><em>Quadric (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{H}</code> condition):</em> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\omega_1\\bar{\\omega}_1+\\omega_2\\bar{\\omega}_3=0</code>. This preserves the horizontal self-duality <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F_A|_H={*_H}F_A|_H</code> (<a href=\"#ex:self-dual-curvature\" data-at=\"models-of-qous/archimedean-witnesses\">self-dual curvature</a>) and enforces a Minkowski-like balance between space-like and time-like modes.</li>\n<li><em>Cubic (phase locking):</em> a quintic resonance locks the expansion of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ln_q</code> to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\exp_q</code>. This preserves the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">C_5</code> symmetry and the Descartes condition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\chi=-6</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/omega-constraints.md","heading":"Remark","number":"8.8.3","page":"b/rem-omega-constraints","qa":{"counts":{"pass":60,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":0},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}}}
